# PR 1: Hold scrollTop writes in _holdOffset while a wheel gesture is live
#   (150ms re-armed timer when targetWindow is present, deferring 50ms while
#   scrollTop is still moving) and flush via _flushHoldIfReady so WebKit wheel
#   replay cannot fight prepend/resize writes.
# PR 2: Reconcile unseen live scrollTop mutations in applyScrollAdjustment.
